DTSTART:20250809T023000Z
DTEND:20250809T044000Z
DTSTAMP:20250809T023000Z
UID:kjZchP36kO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 106 mins (1h46m)\n\nThe definitive tale of Jeff Buck
 ley\, the rising young star with an otherworldly voice whose suddan death 
 at age 30\, after the release of his critically acclaimed debut album "Gra
 ce\," shocked the world. Told through never-before-seen footage from Buckl
 ey’s archives and intimate accounts.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-t
 heaters/its-never-over-jeff-buckley
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
