BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seattle 48 Hour Film Project Screening and Awards 2025
DTSTART:20250812T020000Z
DTEND:20250812T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20250812T020000Z
UID:AQ9wnnoX9Y
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPresented by Create 48 Media Net
 work Come celebrate the best of the 2025 Seattle 48 Hour Film Project. We 
 will screen a selection of the award winning short films\, hand out awards
  and make a whole bunch of local filmmakers extremely happy! Join us for a
 n exciting evening at the Uptown Theater as we celebrate the incredible ta
 lent and creativity of Seattle's filmmakers\, showcasing the best films th
 at were created during this year's competition. Enjoy a diverse range of f
 ilms\, cheer on your favorite teams\, and witness the announcement of the 
 winners who will advance to Filmapalooza 2026 in Lisbon\, Portugal\, and a
  shot at the Cannes Film Festival! $20 ($12 Members\, Students\, Seniors\,
  and Veterans)\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-48-hour-
 film-project-screening-and-awards-2025
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
